=== The reduction sequence IS the derivation, backwards ===
  num + num * num
      1. num -> F
      2. F -> T
      3. T -> E
      4. num -> F
      5. F -> T
      6. num -> F
      7. T * F -> T
      8. E + T -> E

  num * num + num
      1. num -> F
      2. F -> T
      3. num -> F
      4. T * F -> T
      5. T -> E
      6. num -> F
      7. F -> T
      8. E + T -> E

